ሳ ህንራፈሙ፤ ህንሶዳቱስ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ዹመረትስ ዲኖተሳ ሞአተ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"እን ንብትኔሴ፤ ህዬዪፍስ ንኬኔ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ቀጄሉማንሳ በረ በራን ንጅራተ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ጋንፍሳስ ኡልፍናን ኦል ቀበመ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"ነምን ሀማን ዋን ከነ አርጌ ኣረ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እልካንሳ ቀረ፤ በቄስ ንበደ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ሀዊን ሀሞታ ፋይዳ መሌ ሀፈ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/112.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/113.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/111.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}